---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import { membership } from '../data/membership.mjs';
import '../styles/membership.css';
---
<Platform canonicalPath="/membership" title="Membership" description="One Digivated Membership gives you the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, every member-only carousel, one reviewed project spotlight, and News access when it launches. $5 once.">
<section class="membership-page" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
  <header class="membership-heading"><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED MEMBERSHIP</p><h1 id="membership-title">One membership.<br/><em>Full access to member content.</em></h1><p>Get the complete UI/UX Prompt Packet, every member-only guide, one reviewed project spotlight, and News access when it launches.</p></header>
  <article class="membership-offer" aria-label="Digivated Membership offer">
    <div class="membership-offer-heading"><span class="membership-plan-label">The complete membership</span><span class="membership-once">One-time purchase</span></div>
    <div class="membership-price"><strong>${membership.priceUSD}</strong><span>USD once<br/><small>No recurring charges</small></span></div>
    <div class="membership-benefits">
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full UI/UX Prompt Packet</h2><p>All 75 prompts, the complete prompt builder, eight workflows, eight checklists, examples, and learning material. No separate packet purchase needed.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="layers" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Every member-only guide</h2><p>Full access to the complete members-only carousel library and its references.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="sparkle" size={22}/></span><div><h2>One project spotlight</h2><p>One featured placement is included. Submit a working project for review; it must meet Digivated’s listing rules before it goes live.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full News access <span class="membership-soon">Coming soon</span></h2><p>Full access to members-only News when it launches. News is not available yet, and no launch date is promised.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="membership-access-note"><strong>All member-only content is included.</strong> Project discovery, free samples, and standard submissions remain free for everyone.</p>
    {membership.checkoutReady ? <a class="button primary membership-checkout" href={membership.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once <UiIcon name="external" size={17}/></a> : <><button class="button primary membership-checkout" disabled>Checking Gumroad checkout…</button><p class="membership-checkout-note" role="status">Checking the live $5 one-time Gumroad offer. If checkout is unavailable, try again shortly.</p></>}
    <p class="membership-small">Checkout, receipts, and applicable taxes are handled by Gumroad. There is no monthly or yearly renewal.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="membership-next"><p>Browsing and submitting for ordinary directory review remain free.</p><a href="/submit-project">Share a project <UiIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div>
  <section id="member-sign-in" class="membership-access" aria-labelledby="membership-access-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALREADY A MEMBER?</p><h2 id="membership-access-title">Your membership, right here.</h2><p>Use the license key or purchase email from your Gumroad receipt. Once verified, your membership unlocks the full Prompt Packet and every member-only carousel. Existing Founding Membership purchases continue to work.</p><p id="membership-verified" hidden>Your membership is verified. <a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your included spotlight request</a>.</p></div><div><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button" type="submit">Verify membership</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of membership</button></div></section>
  <section class="membership-faq" aria-labelledby="membership-questions"><h2 id="membership-questions">A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>What does Membership unlock?</summary><p>Everything currently offered as member-only content: the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, every members-only carousel and reference, and News access when it launches. Membership also includes one reviewed project spotlight. Public project discovery, free samples, and ordinary project submissions remain free.</p></details><details><summary>How do I open the Prompt Packet?</summary><p>Verify your receipt email or license key in the Membership section above, then open the Prompt Packet. You can also enter your Membership license key directly at <a href="/access">digivated.com/access</a>. You do not need to buy the Prompt Packet separately.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a subscription?</summary><p>No. Membership costs $5 USD once. There are no recurring charges or automatic renewals.</p></details><details><summary>How does the project spotlight work?</summary><p>Your membership includes one project spotlight. Sign in, then choose the membership option when submitting your project. Digivated reviews its image, description, and destination before featuring it. Projects must meet the site’s listing rules; payment does not bypass review or guarantee traffic, sales, or engagement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I read News today?</summary><p>Not yet. The News section is being built. Your membership will include full News access when it launches; no launch date is being promised.</p></details><details id="previous-purchases"><summary>What about a previous purchase?</summary><p>Existing purchases keep their original access. <a href="/access">Open your Prompt Packet</a>, <a href="/carousels">browse your carousels</a>, or use the membership form above. If you previously purchased a standalone promotion, <a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">submit that existing purchase for review</a>. Those products are no longer advertised for separate purchase on Digivated.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul></details></section>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js'; import '../scripts/membership-checkout.js';</script>
</Platform>
